<title>UK: LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</title>
<headline>LONDON CURRENCY AND GOLD BULLION RATES.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Reuter - Following are the buying and selling rates for leading world currencies and gold against the dollar on the London foreign exchange and bullion markets today.</p>
<p>(Tourist rates will differ from those quoted)</p>
<p>US$1.00 COSTS    1.3671/76  Canadian Dollars</p>
<p>		     1.5229/36  German Marks</p>
<p>		     1.7084/94  Dutch Guilders</p>
<p>		     1.2525/35  Swiss Francs</p>
<p>		     31.38/39   Belgian Francs</p>
<p>		     5.1516/26  French Francs</p>
<p>		     1516.0/8.0 Italian Lire</p>
<p>		     110.64/71  Japanese Yen</p>
<p>		     6.6567/42  Swedish Crowns</p>
<p>		     6.4934/54  Norwegian Crowns</p>
<p>		     5.8488/08  Danish Crowns</p>
<p>		     1.4076/86  Singapore Dollars</p>
<p>		     0.7924/29  Australian Dollars</p>
<p>		     7.7320/30  Hong Kong Dollars</p>
<p>One Sterling     US$1.5604/12</p>
<p>Gold (ounce)     US$381.10/381.60</p>
</text>
